# Everything in this directory is PRODUCED, never authored.
#
# `scripts/package-sidecar.mjs` fills it with the Next standalone tree and the
# Node runtime that runs it; both are build outputs and neither belongs in
# version control -- the runtime is a platform binary of tens of megabytes and
# the tree is regenerated from `apps/web` on every build.
#
# The DIRECTORY is tracked, and that is deliberate rather than an accident of
# needing a placeholder: `tauri.conf.json` names it under `bundle.resources`,
# and `tauri-build` refuses at build time when a declared resource path does not
# exist. A missing directory therefore breaks `cargo check`, which is the one
# verification this crate has.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
